    {
      "source": "Kurohiko",
      "url": "https://hok.kurohiko.id/",
      "field": "tactical_tips",
      "content": "Feyd itu jungler super lincah, cepet bantu tim, dan jago ngabisin musuh, tapi lemah di level 1. Ganggu jungle-nya di awal buat ngacak ritmenya. Setelah level 4 backline jauhin tembok biar dia gak bisa ngabisin. Tekan dia di awal pakai jungler kuat kayak Pei, Cirrus, Wukong, tanpa gold di awal dia susah bangkit. Juga efektif: Chang'e/Diaochan/Jin Chan (mage), Zhang Fei/Liu Shan/Donghuang (support), Consort Yu/Di Renjie/Fang (marksman), Menki/Biron/Li Xin/Charlotte (clash)."
    },
    {
      "source": "HoKStats",
      "url": "https://hokstats.gg/heroes/feyd/",
      "field": "guide",
      "content": {
        "skills": [
          {
            "name": "Jade Carriage - View from Above",
            "description": "Can jump onto and walk on natural walls. Basic Attack becomes ranged while on a wall.",
            "type": "passive"
          },
          {
            "name": "Jade Chase - Returning Strike",
            "description": "Dashes, dealing damage to enemies in his path and launching them. Enhances his next 3 Basic Attacks. Enhanced Basic Attacks deal extra damage and restore Health.",
            "type": "skill1"
          },
          {
            "name": "Stepping on Jade",
            "description": "Jumps onto the target wall.",
            "type": "skill2"
          },
          {
            "name": "Hardened Jade Seal",
            "description": "Damages and marks nearby enemies. Using the skill again unleashes 4 strikes of damage. The last strike will defeat marked enemies with low health. Can use to jump down from walls.",
            "type": "ultimate"
          }
        ],
        "pick_when": [
          "The map shape favors gank routes, where mobility translates directly into kills",
          "Your team can engage first, letting Feyd second-wave into low-health targets",
          "The enemy composition leaves room for Feyd to reach the targets his kit punishes."
        ],
        "avoid_when": [
          "The enemy stacks crowd control that interrupts the engage before damage goes out",
          "Your team has no primary engage, leaving the cleanup pick with nothing to follow up on",
          "The enemy team is built around answers to Gap-Close, removing the windows Feyd's kit needs to perform."
        ],
        "power_spikes": [
          "Early game: jungle clear into level-4 ganks is the first window where Feyd can translate routes into kills.",
          "Ultimate unlocked: Hardened Jade Seal converts mobility into burst, the moment Feyd starts threatening picks across the map",
          "Late game: cooldowns become short enough that Stepping on Jade influences every team fight rather than being a one-shot tool."
        ],
        "common_mistakes": [
          "Engaging without follow-up — gap-close gets you to the target, but a solo dive without ally damage trades 1-for-1.",
          "Engaging first instead of second — cleanup picks lose their value as primary engagers.",
          "Engaging without checking enemy summoner-spell cooldowns, which often decide whether Feyd's commit reaches the target alive.",
          "Pathing predictably and getting tracked by the enemy jungler — vary first clear and rotate based on ward placement rather than muscle memory."
        ],
